exports[`safebutwhere copy: what the plugin says about itself > help through the intent model, and a message it can't read 1`] = `
{
  "reactions": [],
  "sent": [
    {
      "group": null,
      "ref": null,
      "text": "*SafeButWhere*

Send a photo of where you put something, a line like _passport, blue file, top shelf_, or both. I keep it.

Words sent right after a photo are kept with it. Send several photos and then the words, and every photo gets them.
_#documents_ in your words is a tag.
Share your location right after, and the position is kept too.

_where is my passport_ brings it back, photo and all
_recent_ shows the last things you kept
_tags_ shows your tags
React to a photo or a line with any emoji, like 🔑, and it joins that group. Send the emoji on its own to see the group. _groups_ shows them all.
_undo_ removes the last thing you kept
Share your location on its own to see what you kept near there.

Reply to a photo, a line of yours or an answer of mine with new words to change it, a _#tag_ to add one, or _delete_ to remove it.

Everything is on app.whatodo.today too.",
    },
  ],
  "unsures": [
    "I have nothing on "hmm". To keep it, say where it is too: _hmm, top shelf_.",
  ],
}
`;

exports[`safebutwhere copy: what the plugin says about itself > welcome, help and group name 1`] = `
{
  "groupName": "📍 SafeButWhere",
  "help": "*SafeButWhere*

Send a photo of where you put something, a line like _passport, blue file, top shelf_, or both. I keep it.

Words sent right after a photo are kept with it. Send several photos and then the words, and every photo gets them.
_#documents_ in your words is a tag.
Share your location right after, and the position is kept too.

_where is my passport_ brings it back, photo and all
_recent_ shows the last things you kept
_tags_ shows your tags
React to a photo or a line with any emoji, like 🔑, and it joins that group. Send the emoji on its own to see the group. _groups_ shows them all.
_undo_ removes the last thing you kept
Share your location on its own to see what you kept near there.

Reply to a photo, a line of yours or an answer of mine with new words to change it, a _#tag_ to add one, or _delete_ to remove it.

Everything is on app.whatodo.today too.",
  "welcome": "📍 You've added *SafeButWhere*.

When you put something away, send me a photo of the spot, a line like _passport, blue file, top shelf_, or both. When you can't find it, ask: _where is my passport_.

Send _help_ for more.",
}
`;
